d","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Topshelf_Records"]}},"/api/discogs/label/29377/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"29377","image":"https://i.discogs.com/aw3_u_a2TqqK8HE9zbXS7ym6sd8uvWhxq628dlsjT1U/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTI5Mzc3/LTE2NTAzNjM2MTEt/MTIyNy5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/JvYe0N_yLiEjK2ZJLlfO0197e0qeCEKVZ1mRiFfGgw4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTI5Mzc3/LTE2NTAzNjM2MTEt/MTIyNy5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"!K7 Records was formed by [l=Stud!o K7] as a label for their audio releases. Their previous label was just branded [l=!K7].\r\nTheir logo is \"!K7®\". The ® can be misread as a registered trademark, but it is a stylized abbreviation of \"Records\".\r\n\r\n!K7 Records was started in 1996 as a techno, House & massive Breaks label from Berlin, Germany. Founded in tandem to the already successful \"DJ-Kicks\" mix compilation series, the label was launched to establish a long-term platform for artistic and musical innovation. Early releases from cutting edge producers like Nicolette, K-Hand, Nick Holder and Terrence Parker were released to critical acclaim. In addition to their own releases they also started a label cooperation with G-Stone Recordings, the label of Kruder & Dorfmeister, which became a very fruitful partnership. Teamed up with !K7, releases from Kruder & Dorfmeister, Tosca and Peace Orchestra became some of the most highly regarded (and successful) electronic releases ever.\r\n\r\nFurther signings included internationally regardings artists Smith & Mighty, Ian Simmonds, A Guy Called Gerald, Herbert feat. Dani Siciliano and Rae & Christian. German producers like Shantel, Funkstörung and Terranova were also engaged, and have now advanced into the international league of electronic musicians. In the new millenium, promising new artists like Swayzak, Earl Zinger, Spacek, Mike Ladd and Ghost Cauldron have signed at !K7 and extended their list of top-shelf artists.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, the DJ-Kicks series, with mix CDs by Kruder & Dorfmeister, Kid Loco, Rockers Hi-Fi, Nightmares On Wax, Thievery Corporation, Playgroup and Tiga advanced to become the \"most important DJ mix series ever\" (Mixmag). And !K7 Records has grown into a high profile label with offices in Berlin, London and New York.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Some !K7 releases have a catalog number starting with !K7R, and some with !K7. These are not interchangable, as they reuse the same numbers in each series (i.e. !K7R001 and !K7001 would not refer to the same release). Please ensure that you use to correct prefix for your submissions to avoid errors and duplicates.\r\n\r\nLC 07306\r\n\r\n[b]Katherine Eykelenboom[/b] was the UK label manager, and A&R was headed up by [a=Stefan Strüver]. ","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:29377","relations":{"parentLabel":{"id":666606,"name":"!K7 Label Group"},"sublabels":[{"id":1100080,"name":"!K7 Flavour"},{"id":1678065,"name":"!K7 Sampler"},{"id":2535589,"name":"PengPeng"},{"id":747659,"name":"Subfield"},{"id":847372,"name":"Walk Don't Walk Ltd"}]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/29377-!K7-Records","type":"label","urls":["https://k7.com/","https://www.k7records.com/","http://7k.k7.com/","https://k7records.bandcamp.com/","https://www.dailymotion.com/k7records","https://www.facebook.com/K7Records","https://www.facebook.com/K7MusicGroup","https://www.instagram.com/k7records/","https://myspace.com/k7records","https://soundcloud.com/k7-records","https://twitter.com/K7records","https://twitter.com/K7MusicHQ","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Studio_!K7","https://www.youtube.com/user/K7rec","https://www.youtube.com/@k7records"]}},"/api/discogs/label/48/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"48","image":"https://i.discogs.com/b9vVXUMd_KhK8fZsoZ9nZR47HQ15m_t0fmG1GqHjl2Q/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:356/w:472/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTQ4LTE2/MTAwNTEzNjgtOTQ4/OS5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb